/* ---------------------------------------------- \xAB\u041F\u0440\u043E\u0432\u0435\u0440\u0438\u0442\u044C\xBB \u0438 \xAB\u041F\u0435\u0440\u0435\u043F\u0438\u0441\u0430\u0442\u044C\xBB (2.7) */
/* A Mac: the circle above the field (the iPhone button's look and place); its menu opens under it. */
